{"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guitaripod/wwdc-sessions/master/schema/transcript.schema.json", "id": "wwdc2019-428", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2019/428", "wordCount": 1437, "segments": [{"start": 14.0, "text": "Hello, everyone."}, {"start": 15.0, "text": "Good afternoon."}, {"start": 17.0, "text": "Welcome to the session."}, {"start": 19.0, "text": "My name is Tao."}, {"start": 21.0, "text": "I'm from Core ML Team."}, {"start": 23.0, "text": "Today we're super excited to"}, {"start": 25.0, "text": "talk about a few new features we"}, {"start": 26.0, "text": "added to Create ML this year."}, {"start": 29.0, "text": "In What's New in Machine"}, {"start": 30.0, "text": "Learning Session, you were"}, {"start": 31.0, "text": "introduced to the brand-new"}, {"start": 33.0, "text": "Create ML app."}, {"start": 34.0, "text": "It's a great new tool designed"}, {"start": 36.0, "text": "by Apple to guide you through"}, {"start": 38.0, "text": "the essential steps of training"}, {"start": 40.0, "text": "of machine learning models."}, {"start": 42.0, "text": "We believe this makes your"}, {"start": 43.0, "text": "machine learning workflow easy"}, {"start": 46.0, "text": "and approachable."}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "Now, let's start with Text"}, {"start": 49.0, "text": "Classification."}, {"start": 52.0, "text": "What is Text Classification?"}, {"start": 54.0, "text": "It's a machine learning task"}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "that classifies input text to a"}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "set of predefined labels."}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "You can use it for sentiment"}, {"start": 64.0, "text": "analysis, like classifying text"}, {"start": 67.0, "text": "as positive or negative."}, {"start": 71.0, "text": "Or doing spam detection."}, {"start": 72.0, "text": "Or more complicated things like"}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "topic analysis, classifying text"}, {"start": 78.0, "text": "as food, politics, or science."}, {"start": 83.0, "text": "Now, Text Classification has"}, {"start": 84.0, "text": "been supported since last year,"}, {"start": 86.0, "text": "but this year we're adding the"}, {"start": 88.0, "text": "support for the state of the art"}, {"start": 90.0, "text": "transfer learning."}, {"start": 91.0, "text": "Today, I'm going to give you a"}, {"start": 93.0, "text": "concrete example of how you can"}, {"start": 95.0, "text": "train a Text Classifier using"}, {"start": 97.0, "text": "Transfer Learning."}, {"start": 99.0, "text": "To train such a model, the first"}, {"start": 101.0, "text": "thing you'll want to do is"}, {"start": 102.0, "text": "collect some training data."}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "Once you have the data, you can"}, {"start": 108.0, "text": "organize in an easy way."}, {"start": 111.0, "text": "I have sports, entertainment and"}, {"start": 113.0, "text": "nature."}, {"start": 115.0, "text": "Under each folder, I have a few"}, {"start": 116.0, "text": "text files."}, {"start": 118.0, "text": "And each one of them is a single"}, {"start": 120.0, "text": "training example, and its label"}, {"start": 123.0, "text": "is simply the name of the folder"}, {"start": 124.0, "text": "they are in."}, {"start": 125.0, "text": "And that's it."}, {"start": 127.0, "text": "That's all you need to do with"}, {"start": 128.0, "text": "the data."}, {"start": 130.0, "text": "I'll give you a quick demo to"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "show how you can do this."}, {"start": 132.0, "text": "On my desktop, I have a training"}, {"start": 135.0, "text": "data folder."}, {"start": 140.0, "text": "So, I decided to have a little"}, {"start": 141.0, "text": "bit of fun."}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "Instead of using plain text as"}, {"start": 144.0, "text": "the label, I used a few emojis."}, {"start": 147.0, "text": "For example, for entertainment I"}, {"start": 149.0, "text": "use a camcorder."}, {"start": 151.0, "text": "For sport, I'm using an American"}, {"start": 153.0, "text": "football."}, {"start": 155.0, "text": "For nature, I'm using this cute"}, {"start": 156.0, "text": "little tent besides a great pine"}, {"start": 160.0, "text": "tree."}, {"start": 161.0, "text": "You notice there is also this"}, {"start": 162.0, "text": "other folder."}, {"start": 164.0, "text": "This is the training data that I"}, {"start": 165.0, "text": "actually don't want."}, {"start": 166.0, "text": "I want my model to learn such"}, {"start": 169.0, "text": "that anything that's not one of"}, {"start": 171.0, "text": "the three intended class, I want"}, {"start": 173.0, "text": "my model to classify them into"}, {"start": 176.0, "text": "this class."}, {"start": 178.0, "text": "So, let's take a look at a few"}, {"start": 180.0, "text": "examples here."}, {"start": 181.0, "text": "For example if you read this"}, {"start": 185.0, "text": "sentence, there's something"}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "about writer and IMDB."}, {"start": 187.0, "text": "It's clearly something related"}, {"start": 189.0, "text": "to entertainment."}, {"start": 193.0, "text": "If I go into other folder, this"}, {"start": 195.0, "text": "is not one of the three intended"}, {"start": 199.0, "text": "class."}, {"start": 204.0, "text": "That's about data."}, {"start": 205.0, "text": "Now, I'll go to Create ML app."}, {"start": 214.0, "text": "To do that, I go to Developer"}, {"start": 216.0, "text": "Tools and find the Create ML."}, {"start": 222.0, "text": "But I'm going to do a new"}, {"start": 223.0, "text": "document and go to text."}, {"start": 228.0, "text": "I'll name it like that."}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "Create. So, I'm sure you have"}, {"start": 233.0, "text": "seen this user interface in the"}, {"start": 236.0, "text": "earlier session, Object"}, {"start": 238.0, "text": "Connection and Subclassification."}, {"start": 240.0, "text": "So, I'm just going to drag my"}, {"start": 241.0, "text": "training data in directly here."}, {"start": 243.0, "text": "So, it gives you some feedback"}, {"start": 245.0, "text": "about your training data."}, {"start": 247.0, "text": "But what's new about Text"}, {"start": 248.0, "text": "Classifier is this particular"}, {"start": 250.0, "text": "parameter section."}, {"start": 251.0, "text": "So, for today's demo, I'm going"}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "to select Transfer Learning."}, {"start": 257.0, "text": "If we take a look at it, the"}, {"start": 259.0, "text": "first two algorithms actually"}, {"start": 260.0, "text": "have been supported since last"}, {"start": 261.0, "text": "year."}, {"start": 262.0, "text": "And this year we're adding"}, {"start": 263.0, "text": "Transfer Learning."}, {"start": 265.0, "text": "And for the demo I'm going to"}, {"start": 267.0, "text": "use this feature extractor"}, {"start": 268.0, "text": "called Dynamic Embedding."}, {"start": 270.0, "text": "I'll go into the detail about"}, {"start": 272.0, "text": "what is Transfer Learning a bit"}, {"start": 273.0, "text": "later after the demo, but all"}, {"start": 275.0, "text": "you need to know now is Transfer"}, {"start": 277.0, "text": "Learning with Dynamic Embedding"}, {"start": 279.0, "text": "is actually an algorithm that"}, {"start": 281.0, "text": "pays attention to the semantic"}, {"start": 283.0, "text": "meaning of your input text."}, {"start": 287.0, "text": "I'll start training."}, {"start": 289.0, "text": "So, in general, Transfer"}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "Learning takes a bit longer to"}, {"start": 292.0, "text": "train."}, {"start": 293.0, "text": "For this particular data set,"}, {"start": 295.0, "text": "it'll take about five minutes on"}, {"start": 297.0, "text": "this particular machine."}, {"start": 299.0, "text": "So, I'm not going to wait."}, {"start": 302.0, "text": "Instead, I have my pre-picked"}, {"start": 304.0, "text": "solution here that's trained on"}, {"start": 307.0, "text": "exactly the same data."}, {"start": 308.0, "text": "Once the model has been trained,"}, {"start": 312.0, "text": "the accuracy test gives you a"}, {"start": 314.0, "text": "good summary about how your"}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "model performs on different"}, {"start": 318.0, "text": "data, broken down into different"}, {"start": 321.0, "text": "classes."}, {"start": 322.0, "text": "It looks my model has done a"}, {"start": 324.0, "text": "good job on training validation"}, {"start": 326.0, "text": "and testing data."}, {"start": 327.0, "text": "So, I will directly jump to the"}, {"start": 330.0, "text": "output tab."}, {"start": 331.0, "text": "This preview pane gives you some"}, {"start": 334.0, "text": "summary about the model as well"}, {"start": 337.0, "text": "as a few different ways for you"}, {"start": 338.0, "text": "to do some quick experiments."}, {"start": 341.0, "text": "For example, if you go to the"}, {"start": 342.0, "text": "lower right-hand side corner,"}, {"start": 345.0, "text": "you can directly add File to do"}, {"start": 347.0, "text": "a quick test."}, {"start": 350.0, "text": "Or you can track a folder that"}, {"start": 356.0, "text": "the model will be able to make"}, {"start": 357.0, "text": "prediction of all the text file"}, {"start": 359.0, "text": "within that folder."}, {"start": 361.0, "text": "The model actually will use the"}, {"start": 362.0, "text": "entire body of the text in each"}, {"start": 364.0, "text": "file to make a single"}, {"start": 366.0, "text": "prediction."}, {"start": 367.0, "text": "But there is another way for you"}, {"start": 370.0, "text": "to do quick experiment which is"}, {"start": 372.0, "text": "manually typing."}, {"start": 376.0, "text": "So in this particular text input"}, {"start": 379.0, "text": "section, when you, when I type"}, {"start": 382.0, "text": "each space, or if I stop typing"}, {"start": 385.0, "text": "for a little while, the model"}, {"start": 387.0, "text": "will make a prediction."}, {"start": 389.0, "text": "So, let's see how that works."}, {"start": 393.0, "text": "What a comeback win."}, {"start": 396.0, "text": "Sport. Let's try something"}, {"start": 400.0, "text": "different."}, {"start": 402.0, "text": "The season finale adds a twist"}, {"start": 407.0, "text": "to the plot."}, {"start": 409.0, "text": "Which seems about right."}, {"start": 412.0, "text": "Entertainment."}, {"start": 417.0, "text": "I actually also want to try"}, {"start": 418.0, "text": "something more recent and more"}, {"start": 420.0, "text": "relevant."}, {"start": 421.0, "text": "This just came to me last night."}, {"start": 424.0, "text": "The Raptors are on top of the"}, {"start": 435.0, "text": "mountain."}, {"start": 438.0, "text": "Nature ."}, {"start": 440.0, "text": "Well, if I switch context."}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "It predicts sport."}, {"start": 453.0, "text": "So, I'm pretty happy with the"}, {"start": 455.0, "text": "model performance."}, {"start": 456.0, "text": "Now I'm ready to deploy."}, {"start": 458.0, "text": "So, I just simply drag it out"}, {"start": 460.0, "text": "and I can put it on my iOS"}, {"start": 462.0, "text": "devices."}, {"start": 471.0, "text": "That's how you can train a Text"}, {"start": 473.0, "text": "Classifier using Transfer"}, {"start": 474.0, "text": "Learning."}, {"start": 476.0, "text": "But you might want to ask what"}, {"start": 478.0, "text": "is Transfer Learning?"}, {"start": 482.0, "text": "Transfer Learning is a powerful"}, {"start": 483.0, "text": "machine learning technique where"}, {"start": 485.0, "text": "a model trained on a huge amount"}, {"start": 487.0, "text": "of data for one particular task"}, {"start": 490.0, "text": "can be repurposed for another"}, {"start": 491.0, "text": "task so that you, as developers,"}, {"start": 495.0, "text": "only need to prepare limited"}, {"start": 497.0, "text": "amount of data and still get"}, {"start": 499.0, "text": "your customized machine learning"}, {"start": 500.0, "text": "model."}, {"start": 501.0, "text": "Create ML actually uses Transfer"}, {"start": 505.0, "text": "Learning for image"}, {"start": 506.0, "text": "classification today."}, {"start": 508.0, "text": "And now we're bringing it to"}, {"start": 511.0, "text": "text."}, {"start": 512.0, "text": "Well, to train a good Transfer"}, {"start": 514.0, "text": "Learning model for text, the"}, {"start": 516.0, "text": "problem is a little bit"}, {"start": 517.0, "text": "different."}, {"start": 519.0, "text": "If you read this sentence, \"I"}, {"start": 521.0, "text": "was able to park my car near the"}, {"start": 523.0, "text": "park entrance.\""}, {"start": 526.0, "text": "For a model that's trained with"}, {"start": 529.0, "text": "conventional technique or study"}, {"start": 531.0, "text": "embedding, these two parts will"}, {"start": 534.0, "text": "look exactly the same."}, {"start": 537.0, "text": "But for a model trained with"}, {"start": 539.0, "text": "Transfer Learning with Dynamic"}, {"start": 541.0, "text": "Embedding, because it pays"}, {"start": 543.0, "text": "attention to the semantic"}, {"start": 544.0, "text": "meaning of the overall context,"}, {"start": 547.0, "text": "it is able to figure out these"}, {"start": 549.0, "text": "two parts actually mean"}, {"start": 551.0, "text": "different things."}, {"start": 556.0, "text": "To train such a good model, you"}, {"start": 558.0, "text": "need to do it on many texts."}, {"start": 560.0, "text": "That's exactly what we did."}, {"start": 562.0, "text": "We trained on billions of text"}, {"start": 566.0, "text": "and shipped that pretrained"}, {"start": 568.0, "text": "model to your mobile devices."}, {"start": 570.0, "text": "And more importantly, we"}, {"start": 571.0, "text": "optimized its performance so"}, {"start": 574.0, "text": "that you only need to prepare"}, {"start": 578.0, "text": "your limited amount of raw text,"}, {"start": 580.0, "text": "send it in to Create ML app."}, {"start": 584.0, "text": "Underneath it, it'll interact"}, {"start": 586.0, "text": "with the model that's already"}, {"start": 587.0, "text": "part of your OS and gives your"}, {"start": 590.0, "text": "customized text classifier."}, {"start": 595.0, "text": "And you can deploy the same"}, {"start": 597.0, "text": "model on your iOS devices"}, {"start": 599.0, "text": "seamlessly because the"}, {"start": 601.0, "text": "pretrained model is already"}, {"start": 603.0, "text": "there for you to use."}, {"start": 606.0, "text": "Now, that's the workflow to use"}, {"start": 609.0, "text": "the Create ML app to train your"}, {"start": 611.0, "text": "Text Classifier."}, {"start": 613.0, "text": "If you're also interested in"}, {"start": 615.0, "text": "writing code, it's also very"}, {"start": 617.0, "text": "easy."}, {"start": 618.0, "text": "To use the Transfer Learning"}, {"start": 620.0, "text": "with Dynamic Embedding, the only"}, {"start": 622.0, "text": "thing you need to specify is"}, {"start": 623.0, "text": "this model parameter."}, {"start": 625.0, "text": "The rest of the code is exactly"}, {"start": 627.0, "text": "the same as last year."}, {"start": 632.0, "text": "Now, I've shown you how to train"}, {"start": 635.0, "text": "Text Classifier, but I'd like to"}, {"start": 637.0, "text": "give you a few simple tips to"}, {"start": 639.0, "text": "get the most out of your Text"}, {"start": 641.0, "text": "Classifier."}, {"start": 645.0, "text": "Now, choose an algorithm which"}, {"start": 647.0, "text": "suits your use case."}, {"start": 650.0, "text": "Transfer Learning is only one of"}, {"start": 651.0, "text": "the three algorithms that Text"}, {"start": 653.0, "text": "Classifier supports."}, {"start": 657.0, "text": "Different algorithms have"}, {"start": 658.0, "text": "different tradeoffs."}, {"start": 660.0, "text": "To find out which one fits your"}, {"start": 662.0, "text": "use case best, please go to the"}, {"start": 664.0, "text": "Natural Language session that"}, {"start": 665.0, "text": "happens after this."}, {"start": 670.0, "text": "Provide balanced classes."}, {"start": 672.0, "text": "This is very important."}, {"start": 674.0, "text": "In the particular example that I"}, {"start": 675.0, "text": "showed you, because each text"}, {"start": 677.0, "text": "file is a single training"}, {"start": 679.0, "text": "example."}, {"start": 680.0, "text": "So, I roughly kept the same"}, {"start": 682.0, "text": "amount of text files in each of"}, {"start": 684.0, "text": "the folders."}, {"start": 688.0, "text": "Data consistency."}, {"start": 689.0, "text": "If you expect your Text"}, {"start": 691.0, "text": "Classifier to mostly work on"}, {"start": 693.0, "text": "short sentences, like I do, your"}, {"start": 695.0, "text": "training data should be mostly"}, {"start": 697.0, "text": "consisting of such examples."}, {"start": 699.0, "text": "If you expect your Text"}, {"start": 702.0, "text": "Classifier to work on short"}, {"start": 704.0, "text": "words, paragraphs, or even an"}, {"start": 707.0, "text": "entire article, you also want to"}, {"start": 709.0, "text": "make sure your training data"}]}
